# <type>(<optional scope>): <imperative subject>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, style.
# Keep the subject short and leave off the trailing period.
# For a breaking change, add ! before the colon.
#
# Add a blank line before the optional body. Explain what changed and why.
# Wrap the body at 72 characters.
#
# After a blank line, reference each Jira ticket on its own line.
# Use `Closes SODEV-1234` if the commit completes the ticket.
# Use `Related to SODEV-1234` if the commit contributes to the ticket.
#
# Example
# fix(courses): Preserve the teacher filter
#
# Keep the selected filter when navigating back to the course list.
#
# Closes SODEV-1234
